            "heading": "",
            "width": "narrow",
            "content": "<p>By using this website you agree to these terms.</p><h3>Medical information</h3><p>Content on this website is for general information only and is not a substitute for professional medical advice. In an emergency, call the hospital's emergency number or go to the nearest emergency department.</p><h3>Appointments</h3><p>An appointment request is confirmed only after our help desk contacts you. Consultation timings may change without notice.</p><h3>Prices</h3><p>Package prices shown are indicative and may change. The final amount is confirmed at the hospital.</p>"
